{"book":"zhongyong","id":"sishu.zhongyong.01","index":1,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.01.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mìng","traditional":"命","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"谓","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"謂","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xìng","traditional":"性","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"shuài","traditional":"率","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xìng","traditional":"性","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"谓","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"謂","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"xiū","traditional":"修","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"谓","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"謂","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiào","traditional":"教","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Firman Tian (Tian - Thian) (Tuhan Yang Maha Esa) itulah dinamai Watak Sejati. Hidup mengikuti Watak Sejati itulah dinamai menempuh Jalan Suci. Bimbingan menempuh Jalan Suci itulah dinamai Agama."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.01.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"kě","traditional":"可","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"须","pinyin":"xū","traditional":"須","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yú","traditional":"臾","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"离","pinyin":"lí","traditional":"離","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"kě","traditional":"可","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"离","pinyin":"lí","traditional":"離","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"fēi","traditional":"非","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"是","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiè","traditional":"戒","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shèn","traditional":"慎","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dǔ","traditional":"睹","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"kǒng","traditional":"恐","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"惧","pinyin":"jù","traditional":"懼","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"闻","pinyin":"wén","traditional":"聞","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Jalan Suci itu tidak boleh terpisah biar sekejappun. Yang boleh terpisah, itu bukan Jalan Suci. Maka seorang Junzi - Kuncu hati-hati teliti kepada Dia yang tidak kelihatan, khawatir takut kepada dia yang tidak terdengar."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.01.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"mò","traditional":"莫","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"见","pinyin":"jiàn","traditional":"見","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"隐","pinyin":"yǐn","traditional":"隱","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"mò","traditional":"莫","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"显","pinyin":"xiǎn","traditional":"顯","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wēi","traditional":"微","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditiona