aditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dà","traditional":"大","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"běn","traditional":"本","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"hé","traditional":"和","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"达","pinyin":"dá","traditional":"達","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Gembira, marah, sedih, senang, sebelum timbul, dinamai Tengah; setelah timbul tetapi masih tetap di dalam batas Tengah, dinamai Harmonis. Tengah itulah pokok besar daripada dunia dan keharmonisan itulah cara menempuh Jalan Suci di dunia."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.01.05","number":5,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"致","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhōng","traditional":"中","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hé","traditional":"和","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dì","traditional":"地","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"位","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"万","pinyin":"wàn","traditional":"萬","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yù","traditional":"育","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Bila dapat terselenggara Tengah dan Harmonis, maka kesejahteraan akan meliputi langit dan bumi, segenap makhluk dan benda akan terpelihara. TENGAH SEMPURNA BAB I (susilawan/Junzi - Kuncu)"}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/01 - Bab Utama.md","title":"Bab Utama"}
